@host = http://localhost:5243
@deliveryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@accessToken = development-only-placeholder

### Production authentication
# Add this header to protected requests when ApiSecurity:RequireAuthentication=true:
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (PostgreSQL)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Active deliveries
GET {{host}}/api/v1/deliveries
Accept: application/json

### Daily energy balance
GET {{host}}/api/v1/energy-balance
Accept: application/json

### Register a delivery
POST {{host}}/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "truckPlate": "ABC1D23",
  "forestOrigin": "Modulo Florestal Mucuri-04",
  "woodSpecies": "Eucalyptus Urograndis",
  "grossWeight": 50,
  "tareWeight": 10,
  "moisturePercentage": 55
}

### Chat with the industrial agent
POST {{host}}/api/v1/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Analise o balanco energetico atual e recomende uma acao operacional.",
  "history": []
}

### Diagnose one active delivery
POST {{host}}/api/v1/agent/diagnose-delivery/{{deliveryId}}
Accept: application/json
